      "description": "<p>When you perform the 【🛡️Guard】 action, if you choose not to provide cover to another creature, you gain the following benefit until the start of your next turn: when a creature you can see casts a spell, after that creature pays for the spell’s MP cost, you may spend an amount of <strong>Mind Points</strong> equal to <strong>【10 + the spell’s total MP cost】</strong> in order to completely stop the casting of the spell and negate its effects (the spell isn’t cast, but the creature is still considered to have spent their action).</p>\n",
